[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m [response] To solve the problem, we need to maximize the real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(|z| = 4\). Let's denote \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\) where \(\theta\) is a real number. Then we can rewrite the expression as follows:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)(4e^{i\theta}) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4e^{i\theta}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m Simplifying the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m (75 + 117i)(4e^{i\theta}) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4e^{i\theta}} = 300e^{i\theta} + 468ie^{i\theta} + \frac{96 + 144i}{4e^{i\theta}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m Since \(e^{i\theta} = \cos\theta + i\sin\theta\), we can rewrite the expression as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 300(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + 468i(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m Simplifying further, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 300(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + 468i(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = 300\cos\theta + 300i\sin\theta + 468i\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m Combining the real and imaginary parts, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m (300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta) + i(300\sin\theta + 468\cos\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m To simplify the last term, we multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4(\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta)} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m Expanding the numerator, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \[
