[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m So the entire expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \[
