[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1009280)[0m The real part of this expression is \(756\cos\theta - 84\sin\theta\). To maximize this, we need to maximize the expression \(756\cos\theta - 84\sin\theta\). The maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). So, the maximum value of \(756\cos\theta - 84\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{756^2 + 84^2}\).
